CreateLicenseRequest.description:
Request body for creating a license (jetscale_license_and_billing_public.license).

Quotas, billing interval, prices, currency, and max_granted_tokens may be omitted or null;
in that case values are taken from the pricing plan referenced by ``pricing_plan_id``.

get.description:
Return the GCP setup guide markdown.

Pass ``?auth_type=workload_identity_federation`` to get the WIF guide;
omit or pass any other value to get the service-account key guide.
